{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1450223-homebrew-espionage-beats","id":1450223,"title":"[Homebrew] Espionage Beats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-29T13:31:28-07:00","id":1450223,"title":"[Homebrew] Espionage Beats","content":"These are equivalent to the Supernatural Beats of other gamelines, but focused on the themes of Demon. They may be used to buy Demon-specific traits (e.g. Embeds, Exploits, Primum, Merits). You may combine Mundane and Espionage Experiences to pay for Demon-specific traits. The following are the main sources of such Beats, though more may exist at ST discretion. The ST may declare that Espionage and Cover Beats are interchangeable or keep them separate, depending on the needs of the Chronicle.<br /> <br /> 1) You incorrectly assume an undesirable scenario or underestimate the risks of a decision based on incomplete or dubious information. This gives an additional Espionage Beat if it leads you into a trap or ambush specifically tailored to your weaknesses.<br /> <br /> 2) Risk damaging your own Cover in order to investigate an Angel and its Mission. This gives an additional Espionage Beat if you delve deeply into a Facility [DTD Core 242-243] which poses a significant threat to your continued existence if you cannot escape in time.<br /> <br /> 3) You are forced to keep a low profile due to active observation from potential hostile forces and have to think outside the box in order to avoid detection. This gives an additional Espionage Beat if you are caught despite your best efforts and must assume Full Demonic Form while surrounded by the enemy and/or under public scrutiny.<br /> <br /> 4) You inflict serious harm upon a valuable ally to dismiss any suspicions that you are working together. This gives an additional Espionage Beat if said individual decides to turn their back on you and actively contribute to your extermination or recapture.<br /> <br /> 5) Knowingly and willingly expose part of your true nature to someone you do not know very well in order to form a meaningful bond. This gives an additional Espionage Beat if you find out too late that this individual is under the control or influence of the opposition in a way that poses a major threat to you.<br /> <br /> 6) Use falsehoods such as propaganda and fine print to convert mortals into assets in the war against the God-Machine, and have their operations traced back to you. This gives an additional Espionage Beat if an insider deliberately betrays you as a result of discovering the full extent of your lies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 10-27-2022, 02:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-15T10:19:43-07:00","id":1452354,"title":"","content":"I would also add completion of an operation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-29T20:29:59-07:00","id":1453806,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s too focused on stuff going wrong when it\u2019